SUMMARY:Deadline: Alberta Foundation for the Arts: Visual Arts and New Medi
 a Individual Project Funding (March 2027)
DESCRIPTION:Project grants for individual artists in visual arts and new me
 dia (new media explicitly included)\, covering creation\, development\, tr
 aining and marketing. A parallel AFA Film and Video Individual Project Fun
 ding stream shares the same deadline and the same CAD 18\,000 cap. ELIGIBI
 LITY: Canadian citizen\, permanent resident or Protected Person whose prim
 ary residence has been Alberta for at least one full year before applying.
  DEADLINE: 1 March 2027.\n\nOrganisation: Alberta Foundation for the Arts\
 nLocation: Alberta\, Canada. RESTRICTED: Canadian citizens\, permanent res
 idents or Protected Persons with primary residence in Alberta for at least
  one full year before applying.\nAward: Up to CAD 18\,000 per project. No 
 application fee.\nDuration: Per project\n\nMore: https://affta.ab.ca/fundi
 ng/find-funding/visual-arts-and-new-media-individual-project-funding?utm_s
 ource=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
